0", "image": "enpe8n6le03ob04re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "The first element is about the resources as they can be physical, human, facilities, and equipment. It's essential to carefully pick out human resources and equipment as they will be the pillars of the project. The second element is time. Allow buffer time, and try to take into account unexpected events that may occur and delay the development of the project. The third element is human skills. A critical resource for any project, so be sure to look for the best and most qualified people since they will help you to achieve your goals and therefore saving you time and money. The last element is cost where you will have to plan the budget for the project."}, {"time": "74000", "image": "enpe8n6le03ob04re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "Now, some recommendations for time estimation is to foresee the bug cycle; this means to bear in mind the errors and the time it takes to fix them. Also, have everything ready; the sufficient resources to keep everything on track. If you have worked before in the previous versions of the software, it will help you estimate the time that every stage requires."}], "coverimg": "enpe8n6le03ob04re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "enpe8n6le03ob04re2aud01"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "id": 1, "title": ""}, {"_data": [], "contents": [{"value": "Scrabble 01.jpg", "type": "img"}, {"value": "Scrabble 02.jpg", "type": "img"}], "type": "static", "template_override": 1, "id": 2, "title": ""}], "type": "scholar"}]}